:\"We will email\\nyou when it is ready to collect.\"},{\"text\":\"You should bring your library card to collect a reserved item.\",\"line\":10,\"span\":\"Bring your library card.\"},{\"text\":\"Reserved items are on the hold shelf under your surname.\",\"line\":10,\"span\":\"Items are on the hold shelf under your surname.\"},{\"text\":\"You have 7 days to collect a reserved item from the day the library emails you.\",\"line\":10,\"span\":\"You have\\n7 days from the day we email you.\"},{\"text\":\"To extend a hold, you must ask the library before the 7 days are up.\",\"line\":15,\"span\":\"If you cannot get in within the week, ask us before the 7 days are up and we will\\nhold the item for another 7 days.\"},{\"text\":\"If you ask before the 7 days are up, the library will hold the reserved item for another 7 days.\",\"line\":15,\"span\":\"If you cannot get in within the week, ask us before the 7 days are up and we will\\nhold the item for another 7 days.\"},{\"text\":\"The library can extend a hold once per reservation.\",\"line\":16,\"span\":\"We can do this once per reservation.\"},{\"text\":\"A reserved item you do not collect goes back into circulation or on to the next person waiting.\",\"line\":20,\"span\":\"An item you do not collect goes back into circulation or on to the next person\\nwaiting.\"},{\"text\":\"If a reserved item is not collected twice with the same reservation, the reservation is cancelled.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"If this happens twice with the same reservation, the reservation is\\ncancelled and you will need to reserve it again.\"},{\"text\":\"If a reservation is cancelled after the item is not collected twice, you will need to reserve the item again.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"If this happens twice with the same reservation, the reservation is\\ncancelled and you will need to reserve it again.\"}]}","ttft_ms":8277,"type":"result","duration_ms":13002,"uuid":"ef11b9c1-9c11-4d49-957a-bce163d1c96e","ttft_stream_ms":2829,"time_to_request_ms":